## SemanticRequirementEvidence

### DESCRIPTION

One source-owned BoK term citation that matched the requirement. It remains separate from catalog profiles and local component observations.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| id | SemanticEvidenceId | 1 |
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | 1 |
| sourceKind | InformationSourceKind | 1 |
| termId | SemanticTermId | 1 |
| title | SemanticEvidenceText | ? |
| definition | SemanticEvidenceText | ? |
| category | SemanticEvidenceText | ? |
| aliases | SemanticEvidenceText | * |
| datasetId | SemanticDatasetId | ? |
| matchKind | ComponentMatchKind | 1 |
| score | double | 1 |
| rationale | ComponentMatchRationale | 1 |
| freshness | InformationSourceFreshness | 1 |
| observedAt | CatalogRefreshTime | 1 |
| evidenceUri | ComponentReferenceUri | 1 |
| diagnostics | CbdWarning | * |

## SourceAwareObservation

### DESCRIPTION

One source-preserving catalog, development-directory, or local/cache CAR observation returned by read-only search. Missing evidence remains absent and is never completed from another source.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | 1 |
| sourceKind | InformationSourceKind | 1 |
| organization | ComponentOrganization | ? |
| componentName | ComponentName | ? |
| componentKind | ComponentKind | ? |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| versionState | VersionAvailabilityState | ? |
| freshness | InformationSourceFreshness | 1 |
| runtimeMinimum | RuntimeVersion | ? |
| runtimeMaximum | RuntimeVersion | ? |
| artifactChecksumSha256 | ArtifactChecksumSha256 | ? |
| evidenceLocation | ComponentReferenceUri | 1 |
| diagnostics | CbdWarning | * |

