### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| code | ReconciliationIssueCode | 1 |
| message | CbdWarning | 1 |
| sourceIds | ComponentSourceId | * |
| evidenceLocations | ComponentReferenceUri | * |

