## ComponentObservation

### DESCRIPTION

Evidence-bearing observation of one component profile. Source identity, kind, selected version, freshness, and checksum remain attributable and are not silently merged with another source.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | 1 |
| sourceKind | InformationSourceKind | 1 |
| evidenceLocation | ComponentReferenceUri | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| freshness | InformationSourceFreshness | 1 |
| observedAt | CatalogRefreshTime | ? |
| expiresAt | CatalogRefreshTime | ? |
| artifactChecksumSha256 | ArtifactChecksumSha256 | ? |
| diagnostics | CbdWarning | * |

## ComponentOperation

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| service | ComponentServiceName | ? |
| operation | ComponentOperationName | 1 |
| kind | ComponentOperationKind | ? |
| description | ComponentOperationDescription | ? |

## ComponentUsageGuidance

### DESCRIPTION

One attributable usage statement. Observed catalog facts, deterministic intent matching, and externally supplied model inference use distinct statement kinds.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| statementKind | ComponentUsageStatementKind | 1 |
| intent | ComponentUsageIntent | ? |
| statement | ComponentUsageStatement | 1 |
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | 1 |
| sourceKind | InformationSourceKind | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| service | ComponentServiceName | ? |
| operation | ComponentOperationName | ? |
| score | double | ? |
| evidenceUris | ComponentReferenceUri | * |
| rationale | ComponentUsageRationale | 1 |

## ComponentEvidenceAbsence

### DESCRIPTION

One explicit reason why catalog selection or requested evidence is unavailable. It cites the source, version, and evidence URI of the selected evidence or of the same bounded alternative set returned by the response.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| code | ComponentEvidenceAbsenceCode | 1 |
| subject | ComponentEvidenceSubject | 1 |
| message | CbdWarning | 1 |
| sourceIds | ComponentSourceId | * |
| versions | ComponentVersion | * |
| evidenceUris | ComponentReferenceUri | * |

